Flatten nested isolation passes and multipart geometry recursively.
combined_normal appends the list returned by generate_envelope, so a
one-level flattener asserts on valid isolation output. Preserve atomic
geometry (including polygon holes), omit empties, and propagate the
requested simplification tolerance to every leaf.

